

# <type>(<scope>): <description>
#
# <body: the motivation and what changed, wrapped at 72 characters>
#
# <footer: BREAKING CHANGE: ..., Fixes #123>
#
# type:        feat fix refactor chore docs style test perf ci build
# scope:       optional, the area changed, e.g. (auth) or (ansible)
# description: imperative mood ("add", not "added"), lowercase, no
#              trailing period, subject line under 72 characters
# breaking:    "!" after the type/scope, e.g. feat(api)!: ...
# Keep a blank line between subject, body and footer.
